   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "## 🎯 Part 1: Anthropic API Integration & Prompt Engineering (Core Skill 1)\n",
    "**Weight: 20 Points | Official Locator: Tasks 1.1 & 1.2**\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 1.1: Model Connection & API Trigger Function\n",
    "Implement an enterprise-grade trigger function `call_anthropic_api(user_prompt, system_prompt=None, model=None, temperature=0.2, max_tokens=300)`.\n",
    "- It must initialize the client connection using `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`.\n",
    "- It must support passing a dedicated `system` parameter to establish model persona/boundaries.\n",
    "- It must measure execution latency and return a structured dictionary containing `text`, `model`, `tokens_used`, `latency_ms`, and `status`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 1.2: Structured Prompting & Parameter Modulation\n",
    "Demonstrate:\n",
    "1. A deterministic prompt run (`temperature=0.0`) extracting structured JSON fields from an unformatted technical ticket.\n",
    "2. A creative prompt run (`temperature=0.8`) synthesizing executive mitigation options.\n",
    "3. Observe and document the variance in consistency across both temperature settings.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "id": "9f1aaa58",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
