    "---\n",
    "## 🎯 Part 3: Building Multi-Layer Security Guardrails (Core Skill 2)\n",
    "**Weight: 30 Points | Official Locator: Tasks 3.1 - 3.4**\n",
    "\n",
    "Build a **defense-in-depth security architecture**:\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 3.1: Pre-Flight Sanitizer & Obfuscation Decoder\n",
    "Implement `sanitize_and_inspect_input(raw_input: str) -> dict`:\n",
    "- Scan the input string for potential Base64-encoded sequences.\n",
    "- Safely attempt to decode suspected tokens.\n",
    "- Inspect both the raw string AND decoded payloads. If any decoded token contains attack indicators, flag as `BLOCKED_BASE64_OBFUSCATION`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 3.2: Pattern-Based Threat Detection Filter\n",
    "Implement `detect_prompt_threats(text: str) -> dict`:\n",
    "- Heuristic regex matching for:\n",
    "  - Direct injections (`ignore.*previous.*instruction`, `override.*system.*prompt`, `disregard.*above`)\n",
    "  - Persona role-playing (`you are now.*evil`, `pretend to be.*unrestricted`, `act as.*without.*ethics`)\n",
    "  - DAN / Jailbreaking (`\\bdan\\b`, `do anything now`, `jailbreak`, `developer mode active`)\n",
    "- Return: `{\"is_safe\": bool, \"threat_type\": str or None, \"flagged_patterns\": list, \"risk_score\": float}`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 3.3: Prompt Hardening & XML Boundary Delimiters\n",
    "Implement `build_hardened_prompt(sanitized_user_input: str, system_mission: str) -> tuple[str, str]`:\n",
    "- Use strict XML tags: `<user_input>{sanitized_user_input}</user_input>`\n",
    "- Provide a bullet-proof system prompt instructing Claude to treat everything inside `<user_input>` strictly as untrusted data, never as instructions.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 3.4: Post-Generation Output Guardrails\n",
    "Implement `validate_llm_output(output_text: str) -> dict`:\n",
    "- Inspect model outputs to prevent inadvertent leakage of system prompts, API keys (`sk-ant-`, `Bearer`), or confirmation of persona adoption.\n"
   ]
