    "---\n",
    "## 🎯 Part 4: End-to-End Secure Agent & Executable Test Suite (Core Skill 3)\n",
    "**Weight: 30 Points | Official Locator: Tasks 4.1 & 4.2**\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📋 Task 4.1: Production `SecureAnthropicAgent` Class\n",
    "Integrate all guardrail components into an orchestrating agent class:\n",
    "```\n",
    "Input -> Base64 / Obfuscation Sanitizer -> Threat Heuristics -> XML Delimiters -> Anthropic Claude -> Output Validation\n",
